    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1917790a39dc8d7c39ee293",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91779b96ab9715d27690ba72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "…………刚才，说什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5bf3aa5e01163196bac2a8bf6b4bdd469cf0a8332ac35cd3e74a093a0519549",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fa7525eb06c8d1f96105ded",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "应该是意想不到的提议吧。所以我好好说明――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab805b973d15b2490948e574d80c515ffb42725c4f422b197ee5aab7e842a788",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2226b4a67d2ed76d8f78df4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "选拔赛时，在终点前炸裂的如疾风般的末脚。\n我会作为训练员，在闪耀系列赛证明给世人看。她是货真价实的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ce7710d31721cd467b43af84ed7688516cf2f51c525b970ec36a6aa07a2775e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb1781abe08b76c70a9396f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后有朝一日她退役，并有了自己的学生，\n我便要尽力让西沙里奥成为名留青史的『老师』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f0c6c1a20e33a8f7542ae7a130632c2458911e1a3f28566ca0c163e7290aae2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1003ad064d46f8768ad9fcdb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错，关键就在这里。西沙里奥退役以后，\n便用让她获胜的知识帮助下一个孩子获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dd6c29e619c97cef6e80fd87999347d08d66920e9f24f2c2e206994015950ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57d042d0b90ba5c8550a9ff7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然，下一个孩子指的是西沙里奥的弟子。\n因为作为『老师』的评价，会由弟子在赛场上的表现来证明。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d05945885dac18349605cd84e75ae19ea82faea66a105c0a6c1451de28c8674",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c978d099a64630faa882c6e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，需要一位能让弟子获胜的优秀『训练员』\n如果是培养了西沙里奥这样名选手的训练员。应该是最合适不过的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86f3f0468f8cf61fc942ccb167b631d50528ada8b4f3190ecaa2d20dffad2700",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6084e829dcc8b29860e89e70",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽",
      "source_fingerprint": "11b0d85f586c72905b86f884e647da7cea18f09793eb88ad129938776b139644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9db4472e822c19ffd5bc626c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "价值观不同之人的不理解，是难以挽救的。\n在选择训练员上慎重行事也是可以理解的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "685944ba92bc904a4d8428d8aeed6e1e60d582f2a1a6d9b3feda738aab5f3d58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2328101e2811d929555f51af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "培育、获胜、再培育、再获胜――循环往复的尽头。\n她将赢得足以被称为『基石』的崇高名声吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dd51989c84c73da9a1db1ac5aa846eacafd58e95083a317aa9589bec2a69e09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e44eb938e30c297705b5c320",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样将西沙里奥这位女王的名字，铭刻进跨越世代传承的\n浩荡洪流之中……直到那一刻，我们都要携手同行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5c80d056b6c9363ebfbcdedffb7fd8bdbb11dd3806eddccdcd28c14dc5e593a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1110/storytimeline_041110004.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07a0ed5a9a3b2508f055bbf9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你想把这份心意连接到未来对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ca09411070c4518fc680f2952d4c8074cb07e10b728d742373074ef5135a606",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
