      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不经意间伸出的手，被西沙里奥的手轻轻覆上。\n心脏怦怦直跳，仿佛在高唱喜悦的诗篇。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b85264e5fd6c96156f0eabb84da608481ac682e9f99efceab19a095bab846bb",
